I stayed at the one in Lower Parel, for one night. The team (Fiza and Arpit) was supportive and kind to me.
The place was decent for a one night stay. There are a few things on cleanliness that I didn’t like, however looking at the options in the area and the reasonable tariff, this is a good option to consider.

@Team Please consider removing the extra mattress behind the bed, it’s dusty and not the cleanest. Also, try vacuuming the bed corners as they have a lot of dust. Thank you.
